{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台に関するコメント沢山ありがとうっ！モバメのお返事もありがとうっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会行くよ報告もありがとうっ！待ってるよ！たまに 昔の同級生とか知り合いからコメントあったりして嬉しかったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁそんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月だって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはドレスとか着てみたいお。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装も好きだけどさ、せっかくだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組とか撮影とかで 可愛い系やりたいよ。ね、ななみん。笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/27/9289291/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ男装系が似合うのも財産ということで。振り幅は広い方が良い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏話。コンビで登場のシーン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/10/27/9289291/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はもっと長かったのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのショートコント。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井『誰か私を応援してくれないかな？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『貴方の為に大きな声で』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井若月『L.O.V.E!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『愛してる、愛してる、愛してる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井『今の応援メッセージは私の為に？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月『いや、テレビの前の貴方にさ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井『私の為じゃないなんて、もぉ怒っちゃうぞ？せーのっ』